    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "American Clipper, the first Pan American four-engine aircrafi,\ndeparts Dinner Key, Miami for Cristibal on its inaugural flight, November 19, 1931.\nLikorsky I-40",
      "CLIPPER.\nCLASS\nWelcome Aboard Pan Am's\nSpecial Business Class\nAperitifs\nChampagne\nLibations\nCocktails\nSpirits\nPremium Beer\nRed and White Wines\nLiqueurs and Cognac\nМопи\nFresh Fruit Medley\nA bouquet of fresh chilled fruit\nCheese and Fine Herb Omelette\nDelicate omelette with a filling of aged cheeses, parsely and chives.\nServed with grilled Chipolata sausage, oven browned potatoes and broiled tomato\nОГ\nGrill Garni\nA mixed grill of tender lamb chop, petit filet steak and plump Chipolata sausage\nServed with au gratin potatoes, broiled tomato and buttered green peas\nFresh Baked Roll and Danish Pastry\nCreamery Butter and Premium Preserves\nNatural Cheese and Fresh Fruit Portions\nFruit Miror\nGlazed slices of fresh Passion fruit\nCoffee\nCoca-Cola\nTaster's Choice Decaffeinated Coffee\nTab\nDiet Coke\nCountry Time® Lemonade Flavor Drink\nTea\nCanada Dry Beverages\nPlease accept our apology if your choice of entree is not available.\n756C\n10-20-83"
    ],
